<title>CANADA: Southam Inc Q3 net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Southam Inc Q3 net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.53     loss	C$0.18</p>
<p> Net	 profit	40,251     loss	13,896</p>
<p> Revs		     266,868		  232,384</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.75   profit	C$0.06</p>
<p> Net	 profit	57,182   profit	 4,687</p>
<p> Revs		     800,575		  734,490</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  76,005		   76,352</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The 1996 third quarter included a C$33.8 million or C$0.44 a share post-tax gain from the sale of the Construction Data group.</p>
<p>-- Lydia Zajc, Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
